  biomeName: The Shattered Spine
  minDepthMeters: 9275
  maxDepthMeters: 9800
  shortDescription: "The mountain\xE2\u20AC\u2122s deepest pulverized gravel fields."
  isPlaceholder: 0
  visitPurpose: Late-game pressure biome. Come here only for major progress, rare
    extraction, and to read walls, fissures, and major vertical routes.
  commonRewardHook: Even routine value here comes from Tungsten Chunk and Rare Earth
    Dust.
  rareRewardHook: 'The reason to risk the trip is: Lithium Crystal and Power Coupler.'
  landmarkIdentity: The Shattered Spine reads through walls, fins, fissures, and
    giant vertical breaks. Landmarks should feel singular and intimidating.
  safePocketIdentity: Safe pockets are rare and temporary. Retreat routes matter
    more than comfort.
  riskSummary: 'Main failure mode: vertical trap geometry and hard commitment, depth
    stress, and expensive hesitation. Creature pressure stays high.'
  extractionFocus: 'Fissure-edge scavenging, hard geometry, and exposed recovery
    points. Deep tier: work edges, cracks, and vertical seams, extract only what
    justifies the risk, and leave cleanly.'
  landmarkGuidance: Dominant landmark is fracture mouth or gate-like break. This
    slot should read through one violent split in the world surface; use walls and
    breaks to mark route commitment.
